{"4306010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Turnt Arena: Perks or Perish", "steam_appid": 4306010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306010/extras/7dd3b55a5170c234d72361c4d07a9a3f.avif?t=1769977710\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span>TURNT Arena: Perks or Perish is an action roguelike MMO where you fight through endless waves of enemies, collect powerful perks, and push your build to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHOOSE YOUR CLASS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple classes including Warrior, Paladin, Monk, and Warlock. Each class offers unique build advantages  and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD YOUR POWER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect up to 100 perks per run. Every choice matters - will you stack damage, go tanky, or create deadly synergies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLIMB THE RANKS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through Normal, Nightmare, Hell, and Endless difficulties. Compete on the leaderboards and prove you have what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GEAR UP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm bosses for powerful loot. Equip weapons, armor, and accessories to boost your stats and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online Mode: Join the MMO server, compete on leaderboards, and party up with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Offline Mode: Play solo with local saves, still in early alpha, not all features available offline- no internet required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FACE THE TRIAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat all 99 rounds? The Trial awaits. Only the strongest builds survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100 perks to collect each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple character classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 difficulty modes + Endless mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online Mode has loot and gear systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Party system for co-op play &amp; Guilds<br>- Online PvP Dueling System available after completing Campaign! (Normal-Hell)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online Global leaderboards<br>- <strong>NEW </strong>rebirth system - Reroll all 100 perks<br> <br><br>- Full Cross-Platform Multiplayer play TURNT Arena anywhere!! Optimized for Phones, Tablets, Mac, Windows, via Internet Browser. Log in via Steam after purchase or via a username/password.  <br><br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306010/extras/7dd3b55a5170c234d72361c4d07a9a3f.avif?t=1769977710\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span>TURNT Arena: Perks or Perish is an action roguelike MMO where you fight through endless waves of enemies, collect powerful perks, and push your build to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHOOSE YOUR CLASS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple classes including Warrior, Paladin, Monk, and Warlock. Each class offers unique build advantages  and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD YOUR POWER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect up to 100 perks per run. Every choice matters - will you stack damage, go tanky, or create deadly synergies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLIMB THE RANKS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through Normal, Nightmare, Hell, and Endless difficulties. Compete on the leaderboards and prove you have what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GEAR UP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm bosses for powerful loot. Equip weapons, armor, and accessories to boost your stats and unlock new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online Mode: Join the MMO server, compete on leaderboards, and party up with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Offline Mode: Play solo with local saves, still in early alpha, not all features available offline- no internet required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FACE THE TRIAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat all 99 rounds? The Trial awaits. Only the strongest builds survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 100 perks to collect each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple character classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 difficulty modes + Endless mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online Mode has loot and gear systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Party system for co-op play &amp; Guilds<br>- Online PvP Dueling System available after completing Campaign! (Normal-Hell)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online Global leaderboards<br>- <strong>NEW </strong>rebirth system - Reroll all 100 perks<br> <br><br>- Full Cross-Platform Multiplayer play TURNT Arena anywhere!! Optimized for Phones, Tablets, Mac, Windows, via Internet Browser. Log in via Steam after purchase or via a username/password.  <br><br> </p>", "short_description": "Battle through 100+ rounds of arena combat, choose 100 perks, and gear up to advance as far as you can. Featuring regular or seasonal leaderboards (damage &amp; speed). Play solo or team up in this action roguelike MMO where every run tests your build.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306010/474d3e794e0f9f948a63c4490eea0f8599b22579/header.jpg?t=1769977710", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306010/5c25b4a548216549755df47ff0d1e6f4f03aeca3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769977710", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306010/5c25b4a548216549755df47ff0d1e6f4f03aeca3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769977710", "website": "https://play.turnthat.com/", "pc_requirements": 